hadiths[199]{hadithnumber,text}:
"109","[AI-translation] Main ek chhupa hua khazana tha; Main ne chaha ke pehchana jaun, to Main ne makhlooq ko paida kiya."
"110","[AI-translation] Na Meri zameen Mujhe sama saki na Mera aasman, lekin Mere momin bande ka dil Mujhe sama leta hai [yani Main apne momin bande ke dil mein rehta hun]."
"111","[AI-translation] Beshak Rahman ke paas ek takhti hai jis mein teen sau pandrah shariaten hain. Rahman farmata hai: Meri izzat aur jalal ki qasam! Mere bandon mein se jo banda Mere paas is haal mein aae ke woh Mere sath kisi ko shareek na karta ho, aur us ke paas in mein se ek bhi ho, woh jannat mein dakhil hoga."
"112","[AI-translation] Main ne khair aur shar paida kiya. To mubarak ho use jis ke hath par Main ne khair muqaddar ki, aur halakat ho us ke liye jis ke hath par Main ne shar muqaddar kiya."
"113","[AI-translation] Jis ne Meri tauheed ka iqrar kiya woh Mere qile mein dakhil ho gaya; jo Mere qile mein dakhil hua woh Mere azab se mehfooz ho gaya."
"114","[AI-translation] Main Allah hun; Main ne bandon ko apne ilm se paida kiya. To jis ke liye Main khair chahta hun use achcha akhlaq deta hun; aur jis ke liye Main shar chahta hun use bura akhlaq deta hun."
"115","[AI-translation] Beshak Mere bandon mein koi hai jis ka iman maal ke baghair durust nahin rehta; agar Main use faqeer kar dun to woh kafir ho jae. Aur Mere bandon mein koi hai jis ka iman faqr ke baghair durust nahin rehta; agar Main use ghani kar dun to woh kafir ho jae."
"116","[AI-translation] Aey Adam ke bete! Din ke awwal mein Mere liye do rak'aten padh, Main tere liye [har mushkil se nijat ke sath din ke] aakhir ki zamanat deta hun."
"117","[AI-translation] Beshak jab banda elaniya achchi tarah namaz padhe aur chhup kar bhi achchi tarah namaz padhe, to Allah Ta'ala farmata hai: Yeh Mera haqeeqi banda hai."
"118","[AI-translation] Teen cheezen: jo un ki hifazat kare woh Mera haqeeqi wali hai; jo unhen zae kare woh Mera haqeeqi dushman hai: namaz, roza, aur ghusl-e-janabat."
"119","[AI-translation] Beshak Main zameen walon par azab bhejne ka irada farmata hun, lekin jab Main un mein unhen dekhta hun jo Meri mohabbat mein Mere gharon ko aabad karte hain aur sehri ke waqt maghfirat mangte hain, to Main [azab ko] un se pher deta hun."
"120","[AI-translation] Jab Allah ne zameen paida ki to zameen hilne lagi; phir Allah ne pahad paida kiye aur unhen us par rakh diya, to zameen thehar gayi. Farishte pahadon ki mazbooti par hairan hue, phir kaha: Aey Rabb! Kya Teri makhlooq mein pahadon se ziyada mazboot koi cheez hai? Us ne farmaya: Han! Loha. Unhon ne kaha: Aey Rabb! Kya Teri makhlooq mein lohe se ziyada mazboot koi cheez hai? Us ne farmaya: Han! Aag. Unhon ne kaha: Aey Rabb! Kya Teri makhlooq mein aag se ziyada mazboot koi cheez hai? Us ne farmaya: Han! Pani. Unhon ne kaha: Aey Rabb! Kya Teri makhlooq mein pani se ziyada mazboot koi cheez hai? Us ne farmaya: Han! Hawa. Unhon ne kaha: Aey Rabb! Kya Teri makhlooq mein hawa se ziyada mazboot koi cheez hai? Us ne farmaya: Han! Adam ka beta jo apne daen hath se sadqa de aur use baen hath se chhupae."
"121","[AI-translation] Jab banda sajde mein so jae, to Allah Azza wa Jalla farishton ke samne us par fakhr farmata hai, farmata hai: Mere bande ko dekho; us ki rooh Mere paas hai jabke us ka jism Meri itaat mein hai."
"122","[AI-translation] Beshak Main ne das lakh ummaten paida kin; koi ummat nahin janti ke Main ne us ke siwa koi paida ki hai."
"123","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne [aayat] padhi: Neki ka badla neki ke siwa kuch nahin [Rahman: 60], phir farmaya: Kya tum jante ho tumhare Rabb ne kya farmaya? Unhon ne kaha: Allah aur Us ke Rasool behtar jante hain. Aap ne farmaya: Woh farmata hai: Jis par Main ne tauheed ki nemat ki us ka badla jannat ke siwa kuch nahin."
"124","[AI-translation] La ilaha illallah kehne walon ko Mere Arsh ke sae se qareeb karo, kyunke Main un se mohabbat farmata hun."
"125","[AI-translation] Arsh par likha hai: Allah ke siwa koi mabud nahin, Muhammad Allah ke Rasool hain; jo yeh kahega Main use azab na dunga."
"126","[AI-translation] Ikhlas Mere raazon mein se ek raaz hai; Main use apne bandon mein se jis se mohabbat farmata hun us ke dil mein rakh deta hun."
"127","[AI-translation] Beshak Main ne qasam khai hai: Mere bandon mein se jo har namaz ke baad use padhega Main jannat ko us ka thikana bana dunga."
"128","[AI-translation] Main Azeez hun; jo duniya aur aakhirat ki izzat chahe woh [Mujh] Azeez ki itaat kare."
"129","[AI-translation] Us bande ko haqeer na samjho jise Main ne ilm diya, kyunke Main ne use haqeer nahin samjha [isi liye use ilm diya]."
"130","[AI-translation] Sakhi mujh se hai aur main us se hun [yani hamara talluq mazboot hai], aur Beshak Main sakhi se qabr ka azab halka kar deta hun."
"131","[AI-translation] Allah Azza wa Jalla qayamat ke din farmaega: Mere padosi kahan hain? To farishte kahenge: Kaun hai jo Aap ka padosi banne ke laiq ho? Phir Woh farmaega: Quran padhne wale aur masjiden aabad karne wale kahan hain? [Yani yehi Mere padosi hain]."
"132","[AI-translation] Jo Quran ki tilawat mein mashghool hone ki wajah se Mujh se dua aur sawal na kar saka, to Main use shukr guzaron ke sawab se afzal sawab dunga."
"133","[AI-translation] Takabbur se bacho, kyunke banda takabbur karta rehta hai yahan tak ke Allah farmata hai: Mere is bande ko sarkashon mein likh do."
"134","[AI-translation] Allah ne duniya ki taraf wahi farmai: Jo Meri khidmat kare us ki khidmat kar, aur jo teri khidmat kare use thaka de."
"135","[AI-translation] [Aey Nabi!] Agar Tum na hote to Allah Arsh, Kursi, zameen, aasman, suraj, chaand aur in ke siwa kuch paida na karta."
"136","[AI-translation] Jo azan ke waqt baat kare to khauf hai ke us ka iman zail ho jae."
"137","[AI-translation] Teen cheezen iman ki bunyad hain: La ilaha illallah kehne wale se [hath] rokna, use kisi gunah ki wajah se kafir na kehna, use kisi amal ki wajah se Islam se kharij na karna; aur jihad Meri besat se jari hai yahan tak ke meri ummat ka aakhri giroh Dajjal se ladega; use na kisi zalim ka zulm batil kar sakta hai na kisi aadil ka adl; aur taqdeer par iman."
"138","[AI-translation] Jab momin ki us ke samne tareef ki jae to us ke dil mein iman badh jata hai."
"139","[AI-translation] Sab se sharif iman woh hai [jo] log tum se mehfooz rahen."
"140","[AI-translation] Sab se afzal iman yeh hai ke tum jano ke Allah tumhare sath hai jahan bhi tum ho."
"141","[AI-translation] Beshak iman ek libas hai; Allah yeh libas jise chahta hai pehnata hai. To jab banda zina kare, Allah us se iman ka libas utar leta hai; phir agar woh tauba kare to Woh use wapas kar deta hai."
"142","[AI-translation] Iman nanga hai; us ka libas taqwa hai, us ka zewar haya hai, aur us ka phal ilm hai."
"143","[AI-translation] Beshak [khair mein] ghairat iman mein se hai, aur fahsh-goi nifaq mein se hai."
"144","[AI-translation] Safed baal iman ka libas hai."
"145","[AI-translation] Iman ke chausath darwaze hain."
"146","[AI-translation] Taqdeer par iman fikr aur gham door karta hai."
"147","[AI-translation] Iman dil ki niyyat aur zaban ke iqrar ka naam hai; aur hijrat [jaan aur maal] se hoti hai."
"148","[AI-translation] Iman haraam cheezon aur lalach ki jaghon se bachata hai."
"149","[AI-translation] Iman do hisse hai: aadha sabr mein aur aadha shukr mein."
"150","[AI-translation] Iman aur amal do bhai hain ... Allah un mein se ek ko doosre ke baghair qubool nahin farmata."
"151","[AI-translation] Aadmi ke iman ke liye kafi hai ke woh kahe: Main Allah se Rabb hone par, Muhammad se Rasool hone par, aur Islam se deen hone par razi hun."
"152","[AI-translation] Miswak karo, kyunke woh safai hai; safai iman ki taraf bulati hai, aur iman apne wale ke sath jannat mein hai."
"153","[AI-translation] Teen cheezen: jis mein hon us ka sawab wajib ho gaya aur us ka iman mukammal ho gaya: aisa akhlaq jis se woh logon mein jee sake, aisa wara jo use Allah ki haraam ki hui cheezon se roke, aur aisa hilm jo use jahilon ki jahalaton se bachae."
"154","[AI-translation] Paanch cheezen iman mein se hain; jis mein in mein se ek bhi na ho us ka iman durust nahin: Allah ke hukm ko qubool karna, Allah ke faisle par razi hona, mamle Allah ke supurd karna, Allah par tawakkul karna, aur museebat ke shuru mein sabr karna."
"155","[AI-translation] Abu Bakr aur Umar se mohabbat iman mein se hai, un se bughz kufr hai; Ansar se mohabbat iman mein se hai, un se bughz kufr hai; Arab se mohabbat iman mein se hai, un se bughz kufr hai."
"156","[AI-translation] Hasad iman ko kharab karta hai jaise [kadwi booti] shehed ko kharab karti hai."
"157","[AI-translation] Miswak aadha iman hai aur wuzu aadha iman hai."
"158","[AI-translation] Sabr ka iman mein wohi martaba hai jo sar ka jism mein hai."
"159","[AI-translation] Sabr aadha iman hai, aur yaqeen poora iman hai."
"160","[AI-translation] Momin log [qatl aur] zabah karne mein sab logon se ziyada narm hain."
"161","[AI-translation] Namaz iman ka sutoon hai, jihad amal ki kohan hai, aur zakat in donon ke darmiyan hai."
"162","[AI-translation] Oon ka libas pehno, apne dilon mein iman ki mithas paoge."
"163","[AI-translation] Ilm Islam ki zindagi aur iman ka sutoon hai."
"164","[AI-translation] Jaise shirk ke sath koi cheez faeda nahin deti, waise hi iman ke sath koi cheez nuqsan nahin deti."
"165","[AI-translation] Har cheez ki bunyad hai, aur iman ki bunyad wara [taqwa] hai."
"166","[AI-translation] Har cheez ka khulasa hai, iman ka khulasa namaz hai, aur namaz ka khulasa pehli takbeer [takbeer-e-tahreema] hai."
"167","[AI-translation] Us momin ka iman mukammal nahin jo aazmaish ko nemat aur khushhali ko museebat na samjhe."
"168","[AI-translation] Iman ki misaal qamees ki tarah hai; kabhi tum use pehente ho kabhi utarte ho."
"169","[AI-translation] Jo sharab piye to Allah us se iman is tarah utar leta hai jaise aadmi apne sar se qamees utarta hai."
"170","[AI-translation] Jo subah fajr ki namaz ki taraf jae woh iman ka jhanda liye jata hai; jo subah bazar ki taraf jae woh Iblees ka jhanda liye jata hai."
"171","[AI-translation] Madinah Islam ka gumbad aur iman ka ghar hai."
"172","[AI-translation] Banda iman ki haqeeqat ko nahin pahunchega yahan tak ke apni zaban ki hifazat kare."
"173","[AI-translation] Poocha gaya: Kaunsa iman afzal hai? Aap ne farmaya: Hijrat."
"174","[AI-translation] Jo Allah ka kasrat se zikr na kare woh iman se bahar hai."
"175","[AI-translation] Jis mein haya nahin us mein iman nahin."
"176","[AI-translation] Ghibat aur chughli iman ko is tarah jhad deti hain jaise charwaha apne janwaron ke liye darakht ke patte jhadta hai."
"177","[AI-translation] Watan se mohabbat iman mein se hai."
"178","[AI-translation] Billi se mohabbat iman mein se hai."
"179","[AI-translation] Iman dil mein mazboot pahadon ki tarah jama hua hai; us mein izafa aur kami kufr hai."
"180","[AI-translation] [Qabeela] Saqeef ka wafd Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Kya iman badhta aur ghat-ta hai? Aap ne farmaya: Nahin; iman dil mein mukammal hai; us mein izafa kufr hai aur us mein kami shirk hai."
"181","[AI-translation] Iman na badhta hai na ghat-ta hai."
"182","[AI-translation] Aadmi mukammal iman nahin pa sakta yahan tak ke mazaq mein jhoot aur haq par hote hue jhagda chhor de."
"183","[AI-translation] Jis ne apne iman mein shak kiya us ke amal zae ho gae aur woh aakhirat mein nuqsan uthane walon mein hoga."
"184","[AI-translation] Jis ke hath par koi Musalman ho us ke liye jannat wajib ho gayi."
"185","[AI-translation] Jis ne kaha: InshaAllah main momin hun, to us ka Islam mein koi hissa nahin."
"186","[AI-translation] Beshak bande ke iman ke kamal mein se hai ke woh apni har baat mein inshaAllah kahe."
"187","[AI-translation] Jo haqeeqi momin na ho woh yaqeenan haqeeqi kafir hai."
"188","[AI-translation] Mere nazdeek Mere doston mein martabe ke lehaz se sab se rashk ke laiq woh momin mard hai jo [duniya mein] halka ho aur namaz ka bada hissa pane wala ho."
"189","[AI-translation] Agar momin ke khauf aur ummeed ko taula jae to donon barabar honge."
"190","[AI-translation] Jo bid'ati ko jhidke to Allah us ke dil ko aman aur iman se bhar deta hai."
"191","[AI-translation] Beshak Allah ne ghoda paida kiya aur use daudaya; woh paseene se bhar gaya, to Allah ne us paseene se apni zaat ko paida kiya."
"192","[AI-translation] Allah aur makhlooq ke darmiyan sattar hazar parde hain."
"193","[AI-translation] Allah Azza wa Jalla ne ek hazar ummaten paida kin; chhe sau samandar mein aur chaar sau zameen par."
"194","[AI-translation] Dil Rabb ka ghar hai."
"195","[AI-translation] Har cheez par ghaur karo, lekin Allah Ta'ala ki Zaat par ghaur na karo."
"196","[AI-translation] Saari makhlooq Allah ka kunba hai; un mein Allah ko sab se mahboob woh hai jo Us ke kunbe ko sab se ziyada faeda de."
"197","[AI-translation] Agar aurten na hotin to Allah ki ibadat ki jati jaisa Us ka haq hai."
"198","[AI-translation] Agar aurten na hotin to mard jannat mein dakhil hote."
"199","[AI-translation] Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke walidain ko zinda kiya gaya yahan tak ke woh Aap par iman lae."
"200","[AI-translation] Sab se pehle Allah ne qalam paida kiya, phir noon paida kiya jo dawaat hai; aur yeh Allah Ta'ala ke farman Noon, qalam ki qasam aur jo woh likhte hain [Qalam: 1] mein hai."
"201","[AI-translation] Jab Adam ne khata ki to kaha: Aey Rabb! Main Tujh se Muhammad (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke haq ke waseele se mangta hun ke Mujhe bakhsh de. To Allah Azza wa Jalla ne farmaya: Aey Adam! Tum ne Muhammad (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko kaise pehchana jabke Main ne use paida bhi nahin kiya? Unhon ne kaha: Aey Rabb! Jab Tun ne mujhe apne hath se paida kiya aur Mujh mein apni rooh phoonki, main ne sar uthaya aur Arsh ke sutunon par likha dekha: Allah ke siwa koi mabud nahin, Muhammad Allah ke Rasool hain; to main samajh gaya ke Tun ne apne naam ke sath sirf use milaya jo Tujhe sab se ziyada mahboob hai. To Allah ne farmaya: Tum ne sach kaha aey Adam! Beshak woh Mujhe makhlooq mein sab se ziyada mahboob hai; [us ke haq se] Mujh se mango, Beshak Main ne tumhen bakhsh diya; aur agar Muhammad (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) na hote to Main tumhen paida na karta."
"202","[AI-translation] Dawud (Alaihissalam) ne kaha: Main Tujh se apne baap dada Ibrahim, Ishaq aur Yaqub ke haq se mangta hun."
"203","[AI-translation] Jab tum Allah se mango to mere martabe ke waseele se mango."
"204","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Mere maan baap Aap par qurban, mujhe bataen sab se pehli cheez ke bare mein jo Allah ne sab cheezon se pehle paida ki. Aap ne farmaya: Aey Jabir! Beshak Allah ne sab cheezon se pehle tere Nabi ke noor ko apne noor se paida kiya; phir Us ne us noor ko aisi qudrat di ke woh Us ki qudrat se jahan Allah chahta ghoomta; aur us waqt na Lauh thi, na qalam, na jannat, na jahannam, na farishta, na aasman, na zameen, na suraj, na chaand, na jinn, na insan."
"205","[AI-translation] Main Allah ke noor se hun, momin mujh se hain, aur khair mujh mein hai aur qayamat tak meri ummat mein hai."
"206","[AI-translation] Main Nabi tha jabke Adam pani aur mitti ke darmiyan the."
"207","[AI-translation] Woh (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) andhere mein dekhte the jaise roshni mein dekhte the."
"208","[AI-translation] Muhammad ka khandan sab muttaqi hai."
"209","[AI-translation] Beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ka saya na dhoop mein nazar aata tha na chaandni mein."
"210","[AI-translation] Beshak Allah ne Musa ko kalam diya aur mujhe [ru'yat] di, mujhe maqam-e-mahmood se fazeelat di aur [hauze] kausar diya jis par [momin] aaenge."
"211","[AI-translation] Jab mujhe aasman ki taraf le jaya gaya, main ne apne Rabb ko dekha; mere aur Us ke darmiyan zahir parda tha; main ne Us se har cheez dekhi yahan tak ke taaj dekha."
"212","[AI-translation] Main ne apne Rabb ko Mina mein oont par dekha jo jubba pehne hue tha."
"213","[AI-translation] Jo meri qabr ki ziyarat kare us ke liye meri shafa'at wajib ho gayi."
"214","[AI-translation] Juma ke din mujh par kasrat se durood bhejo, kyunke woh hazir ka din hai jis mein farishte hazir hote hain; jo banda mujh par durood bhejta hai us ki awaz mujh tak pahunchegi woh jahan bhi ho. Ham ne poocha: Aap ki wafaat ke baad bhi? Aap ne farmaya: Meri wafaat ke baad bhi; Beshak Allah ne zameen par Nabiyon ke jismon ko khana haraam kar diya hai."
"215","[AI-translation] Main khatam-un-Nabiyyin hun; mere baad koi Nabi nahin, siwae is ke ke Allah chahe."
"216","[AI-translation] Hazrat Mu'az bin Jabal (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke jab Nabi ne unhen Yaman bheja to un se farmaya: Jab tumhare paas koi muqadma aae to kais faisla karoge? Unhon ne kaha: Main Kitabullah se faisla karunga. Aap ne farmaya: Agar Kitabullah mein na ho? Unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah ki sunnat se. Aap ne farmaya: Agar Rasoolullah ki sunnat mein bhi na ho? Unhon ne kaha: Main apni rae se ijtihad karunga aur kotahi na karunga. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne un ke seene par hath mara aur farmaya: Sab tareef Allah ke liye jis ne Rasoolullah ke qasid ko us ki taufeeq di jo Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko pasand hai."
"217","[AI-translation] Beshak mere baad kuch rawi honge jo mujh se hadeesen bayan karenge; tum un ki hadeeson ko Quran par parkho; jo Quran ke muwafiq hon unhen lo; jo Quran ke muwafiq na hon unhen na lo."
"218","[AI-translation] Jab tum hadees likho to use us ki sanad ke sath likho."
"219","[AI-translation] Allah apni Kitab ke siwa har kitab ki sehat se inkar farmata hai."
"220","[AI-translation] Mera kalam Allah ke kalam ko mansookh nahin kar sakta, aur Allah ka kalam mere kalam ko mansookh kar sakta hai."
"221","[AI-translation] Jo meri ummat ke deeni mamle mein chalis hadeesen yaad kare, Allah use [qayamat ke din] faqeeh uthaega."
"222","[AI-translation] Jo hadees tumhen mujh se bayan ki jae jise tum pehchante ho use lo; aur jo hadees tumhen mujh se bayan ki jae jise tum ajnabi pao use na lo."
"223","[AI-translation] Jab bid'aten phail jaen aur is ummat ke pichhle aglon par la'nat karen, to jis ke paas ilm ho woh use phailae."
"224","[AI-translation] Jo meri ummat ko aisi hadees pahunchae jis se woh sunnat qayam kare ya bid'at mitade, to us ke liye jannat hai."
"225","[AI-translation] Jo bid'ati ki taraf us ki izzat ke liye chale us ne Islam ko girane mein madad ki."
"226","[AI-translation] Jo bid'ati se Allah ke liye bughz ki wajah se munh pher le, to Allah us ke dil ko aman aur iman se bhar deta hai."
"227","[AI-translation] Jab bid'ati mare to Islam ko fatah naseeb hoti hai."
"228","[AI-translation] Har bid'at gumrahi hai siwae ibadat mein [nayi] bid'at ke."
"229","[AI-translation] Bid'ati makhlooq mein sab se bure hain."
"230","[AI-translation] Meri ummat mein ek aadmi hoga jise Muhammad bin Idrees [yani Imam Shafi'i] kaha jaega, woh meri ummat ko Iblees se ziyada nuqsan dega; aur meri ummat mein ek aadmi hoga jise Abu Hanifa kaha jaega, woh meri ummat ka chiragh hoga."
"231","[AI-translation] Mere Ahle Bait sitaron ki tarah hain; tum un mein se jis ki pairwi karoge hidayat pa jaoge."
"232","[AI-translation] Ulama ki pairwi karo, kyunke woh duniya ke chiragh aur aakhirat ke diye hain."
"233","[AI-translation] Salman hamare Ahle Bait mein se hai."
"234","[AI-translation] Jo hamare deen mein apni rae se baat kare use qatl kar do."
"235","[AI-translation] Ali behtareen insan hain; jis ne inkar kiya us ne kufr kiya."
"236","[AI-translation] Agar log jante Ali ko Ameer-ul-Momineen ka laqab kab mila, to woh un ki fazeelat ka inkar na karte; unhen Ameer-ul-Momineen ka laqab us waqt mila jab Adam rooh aur jism ke darmiyan the."
"237","[AI-translation] Aey Ali! Tum duniya aur aakhirat mein mere bhai ho."
"238","[AI-translation] Ali naik logon ke imam aur badkaron ke qatil hain; jo un ki madad karega madad payega, jo unhen ruswa karega ruswa hoga."
"239","[AI-translation] Main khatam-un-Nabiyyin hun, aur aey Ali! Tum khatam-ul-Auliya ho."
"240","[AI-translation] Quraish se mohabbat karo, kyunke jo un se mohabbat kare Allah Azza wa Jalla us se mohabbat farmata hai."
"241","[AI-translation] Quraish se mohabbat iman hai aur un se bughz kufr hai; Arab se mohabbat iman hai aur un se bughz kufr hai."
"242","[AI-translation] Use Fatimah is liye naam diya gaya kyunke Allah ne use aur us se mohabbat karne walon ko aag se rok diya hai."
"243","[AI-translation] [Aey Fatimah!] Beshak Allah na tumhen azab dega na tumhari aulad ko."
"244","[AI-translation] Islam qayamat ke din aadmi ki surat mein uthaya jaega."
"245","[AI-translation] Duniya aakhirat ki kheti hai."
"246","[AI-translation] Qabr ya to jannat ke baghon mein se ek bagh hai ya jahannam ke garhon mein se ek garha hai."
"247","[AI-translation] Qabr maiyyat se kehti hai jab woh us mein rakha jae: Teri halakat ho aey Adam ke bete! Tujhe mere bare mein kis ne dhoka diya? Kya tu nahin janta ke main andhere ka ghar, aazmaish ka ghar, aur tanhai ka ghar hun?"
"248","[AI-translation] Beshak qabr tumhen har din paanch martaba pukarti hai."
"249","[AI-translation] La ilaha illallah walon ke liye na un ki qabron mein wehshat hogi na un ke uthne mein."
"250","[AI-translation] Jo har juma apne walidain ya un mein se ek ki qabr ki ziyarat kare woh bakhsh diya jaega."
"251","[AI-translation] Jo har juma apne walidain ki qabr ki ziyarat kare aur un ke paas Yasin padhe, to use har aayat ya harf ki ta'dad ke barabar bakhsh diya jaega."
"252","[AI-translation] Khoobsurat chehre ko dekhna nazar tez karta hai."
"253","[AI-translation] Khoobsurat chehre ko dekhna ibadat hai."
"254","[AI-translation] Bhalai khoobsurat chehron ke paas talash karo."
"255","[AI-translation] Istighfar ke sath koi kabeera baqi nahin rehta, aur israr ke sath koi sagheera [sagheera nahin rehta]."
"256","[AI-translation] Jibreel mere paas aae aur kaha: Aey Muhammad! Beshak Allah Aap ko salam farmata hai aur farmata hai: Meri izzat aur jalal ki qasam! Aey Muhammad! Main us shakhs ko aag se azab na dunga jis ka naam Aap ke naam par hai."
"257","[AI-translation] Khilafat Madinah mein hai jabke badshahat Sham mein hai."
"258","[AI-translation] Zina se paida hone wala bachcha jannat mein dakhil na hoga."
"259","[AI-translation] Beshak Quran wale ke liye har khatm par ek qubool hone wali dua hai."
"260","[AI-translation] Balaa baat se wabasta hai [yani khamoshi nijat hai, bolna balaa lata hai]."
"261","[AI-translation] Behtareen kaam woh hai jis mein darmiyan-ravi ho."
"262","[AI-translation] Agar tum mein se koi pathar se bhi husn-e-zann rakhe to woh use faeda dega."
"263","[AI-translation] Momin ki niyyat us ke amal se behtar hai."
"264","[AI-translation] Jo ishq kare phir paak-daman rahe, use chhupae, phir mar jae, to woh shaheed ki maut mara."
"265","[AI-translation] Betiyon ko dafan karna izzat wale kaamon mein se hai."
"266","[AI-translation] Jo mar gaya, Beshak us ki qayamat qayam ho gayi."
"267","[AI-translation] Apna muhasba karo is se pehle ke tumhara muhasba kiya jae."
"268","[AI-translation] Nabiyon aur shaheedon ke baad sab se pehle kapda pehnaya jane wala Bilal hoga."
"269","[AI-translation] Meri ummat ke ulama Bani Israil ke Nabiyon ki tarah hain."
"270","[AI-translation] Jo kisi aalim ki taqleed kare woh Allah se salamti ke sath milega."
"271","[AI-translation] Ilm ki aafat bhool jana hai."
"272","[AI-translation] Jo ilm ki talash mein nikle woh wapas aane tak Allah ke raste mein hai."
"273","[AI-translation] Ek faqeeh shaitan par hazar aabid se bhari hai."
"274","[AI-translation] Aalim ki aabid par fazeelat meri apni ummat par fazeelat ki tarah hai."
"275","[AI-translation] Jo mujh se koi ilm ya hadees likhe, jab tak woh ilm ya hadees baqi rahe us ke liye ajr likha jata rahega."
"276","[AI-translation] Logon mein mere baad sab se sakhi woh mard hai jis ne ilm seekha phir apna ilm phailaya."
"277","[AI-translation] Jab qayamat ka din aaega, sone ke mimbar rakhe jaenge ... phir Rahman ki taraf se pukarne wala pukarega: Kahan hain woh jinhon ne ummat-e-Muhammad (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko ilm pahuncheya, woh use sirf Allah ki raza ke liye pahunchete the? Un par baitho, phir jannat mein dakhil ho jao."
"278","[AI-translation] Beshak aadmi ki apne ilm mein khayanat us ki maal mein khayanat se sakht hai."
"279","[AI-translation] Motiyon ko, yani ilm ko, kutton ke munh mein na phenko."
"280","[AI-translation] Ilm naujawano ke supurd karo."
"281","[AI-translation] Agar mujh par aisa din aae jis mein main ilm mein izafa na karun, to us din suraj ke tulu mein barkat na ho."
"282","[AI-translation] Chaar cheezen chaar se ser nahin hotin: aankh dekhne se, zameen barish se, aurat mard se, aur aalim ilm se."
"283","[AI-translation] Khushamad momin ke akhlaq mein se nahin siwae ilm ki talash mein."
"284","[AI-translation] Beshak jab ustad bachche se kahe: Bismillah-ir-Rahman-ir-Raheem, phir bachcha kahe: Bismillah-ir-Rahman-ir-Raheem, to Allah bachche, us ke walidain, aur us ke ustad ke liye jahannam se azadi likh deta hai."
"285","[AI-translation] Tum mein sab se bure tumhare ustad hain: woh yateem par sab se kam rehem karte hain."
"286","[AI-translation] Ilm ki majlison mein hazir hona hazar janazon mein hazir hone se behtar hai."
"287","[AI-translation] Ustadon, moazzino aur imamon ki ujrat haraam hai."
"288","[AI-translation] Har aalim ke paas na baitho, siwae us aalim ke jo tumhen paanch se paanch ki taraf bulata ho: shak se yaqeen ki taraf, dushmani se khairkhwahi ki taraf, takabbur se tawazo ki taraf, riya se ikhlas ki taraf, duniya ki khwahish se zuhd ki taraf."
"289","[AI-translation] Jab tumhen mujh se koi hadees bayan ki jae jo haq ke muwafiq ho to use lo, khwah main ne bayan ki ho ya na ki ho."
"290","[AI-translation] Jo ghulam ko Kitabullah ki ek aayat sikhade woh us ka aaqa hai."
"291","[AI-translation] Ilm do qism ka hai: badan ka ilm [jaise tib] aur deen ka ilm."
"292","[AI-translation] Ilm do qism ka hai: woh ilm jo dil mein hai, wohi nafa bakhsh ilm hai; aur zaban ka ilm, woh Adam ke bete par Allah ki hujjat hai."
"293","[AI-translation] Jo ilm ka ek bab is liye seekhe ke logon ko sikhade Allah ki raza chahte hue, to Allah use sattar Nabiyon ka ajr dega."
"294","[AI-translation] Beshak jannat wale jannat mein bhi ulama ke mohtaj honge."
"295","[AI-translation] Ilm talash karne ki ek ghadi raat bhar qiyam se behtar hai, aur ilm talash karne ka ek din teen din ke rozon se behtar hai."
"296","[AI-translation] Jab talib-e-ilm ustad ke samne baithe, to Allah us ke liye rehmat ke sattar darwaze khol deta hai."
"297","[AI-translation] Jo ulama ki ziyarat kare us ne meri ziyarat ki; jo ulama se musafaha kare us ne mujh se musafaha kiya."
"298","[AI-translation] Jo apne ilm par amal kare, to Allah use us ilm ka waris bana dega jo us ke paas nahin."
"299","[AI-translation] Sheikh [ustad] apni qaum mein Nabiyon ke apni ummat mein hone ki tarah hai."
"300","[AI-translation] Aalim ke peeche namaz [chaar hazar chaar sau chalis namazon ke] barabar hai."
"301","[AI-translation] Ulama ki siyahi shaheedon ke khoon se afzal hai."
"302","[AI-translation] Is ummat ke munafiqon mein aksar us ke qari hain."
"303","[AI-translation] Badtareen ulama woh hain jo hukmaranon ke paas jate hain; behtareen hukmaran woh hain jo ulama ke paas jate hain."
"304","[AI-translation] Meri ummat par ek zamana aaega jab fuqaha ek doosre se hasad karenge."
"306","[AI-translation] Aalim ke chehre ko dekhna ibadat hai."
"307","[AI-translation] Main ilm ka sheher hun aur Ali us ka darwaza hai."
"308","[AI-translation] Aalim ki maut aisi museebat hai jis ka izala nahin aur aisa shigaf hai jo pur nahin hota."
